  <title>Keyboard shortcuts</title>

  <p>The shortcuts work wherever the focus is in the main window. While a
  box in the Properties panel has the focus, it gets the keys it uses first,
  so <key>Delete</key>, <keyseq><key>Ctrl</key><key>A</key></keyseq> and the
  clipboard keys work on its text.</p>

