  <section id="canvas-keys">
    <title>On the canvas</title>
    <terms>
      <item>
        <title>Arrow keys</title>
        <p>Move the selection one dot, or ten with <key>Shift</key>, once a
        click has given the canvas the keyboard.</p>
      </item>
      <item>
        <title><key>Ctrl</key> with the mouse wheel</title>
        <p>Zoom about the pointer.</p>
      </item>
      <item>
        <title><key>Alt</key> or <key>Shift</key> while dragging</title>
        <p><key>Alt</key> stops snapping; <key>Shift</key> keeps a move along
        one axis.</p>
      </item>
      <item>
        <title><key>Escape</key> in the Properties panel</title>
        <p>Throws away the changes you are in the middle of.</p>
      </item>
    </terms>
  </section>
